      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    principal = 250000.0\n    annual_interest_rate = 0.0375\n    loan_term_years = 30\n    months_in_first_year = 12\n\n    monthly_interest_rate = annual_interest_rate / 12\n    total_payments = loan_term_years * 12\n\n    monthly_payment = (\n        principal * monthly_interest_rate\n        / (1 - (1 + monthly_interest_rate) ** -total_payments)\n    )\n\n    # Calculate the principal portion of each payment during the first 12 months\n    remaining_balance = principal\n    total_principal_paid = 0.0\n\n    for _ in range(months_in_first_year):\n        interest_payment = remaining_balance * monthly_interest_rate\n        principal_payment = monthly_payment - interest_payment\n        total_principal_paid += principal_payment\n        remaining_balance -= principal_payment\n\n    # Return the total principal paid, rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(total_principal_paid)\n```",
